A-Point and its licensors retain all right, title, and interest in and to the Software, including all intellectual property rights. No rights are granted to you except as expressly set out in this Agreement. All rights not expressly granted are reserved.


## 10. Updates and changes

A-Point may provide updates, upgrades, or patches to the Software. Unless an update is accompanied by a separate license, this Agreement governs it. A-Point may modify Software features, tools, and tier limits on a prospective basis.


## 11. Fees and billing

